Package: libxm5
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libmotif-common (= ${source:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Motif - X/Motif shared library
 Motif is the user interface toolkit of the Common Desktop Environment:
 a set of widgets (buttons, menus, lists, text fields, dialogs, ...) for
 X11 applications, built on the X Toolkit Intrinsics.
 .
 This package contains libXm, the Motif widget library.  Its SONAME is
 libXm.so.5: it is not binary compatible with the libXm.so.4 of Motif
 2.3, so programs built against that have to be rebuilt.

Package: libmrm5
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Motif - MRM (Motif Resource Manager) shared library
 Motif is the user interface toolkit of the Common Desktop Environment:
 a set of widgets (buttons, menus, lists, text fields, dialogs, ...) for
 X11 applications, built on the X Toolkit Intrinsics.
 .
 This package contains libMrm, which creates the widget hierarchies
 described by UID files, the compiled form of UIL interface descriptions.

Package: libuil5
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Motif - UIL (User Interface Language) shared library
 Motif is the user interface toolkit of the Common Desktop Environment:
 a set of widgets (buttons, menus, lists, text fields, dialogs, ...) for
 X11 applications, built on the X Toolkit Intrinsics.
 .
 This package contains libUil, the UIL compiler as a library, for
 programs that compile UIL descriptions at run time.

Package: libmotif-common
Section: x11
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Motif - common files
 Motif is the user interface toolkit of the Common Desktop Environment:
 a set of widgets (buttons, menus, lists, text fields, dialogs, ...) for
 X11 applications, built on the X Toolkit Intrinsics.
 .
 This package contains the virtual key binding files that libXm reads
 for the vendor of the X server.

Package: libmotif-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libfontconfig-dev,
 libjpeg-dev,
 libmrm5 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libpng-dev,
 libuil5 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libx11-dev,
 libxext-dev,
 libxft-dev,
 libxm5 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libxmu-dev,
 libxpm-dev,
 libxt-dev,
 pkgconf,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Motif - development files
 Motif is the user interface toolkit of the Common Desktop Environment:
 a set of widgets (buttons, menus, lists, text fields, dialogs, ...) for
 X11 applications, built on the X Toolkit Intrinsics.
 .
 This package contains the headers of libXm, libMrm and libUil, the
 pkg-config files (motif, mrm, uil), the CMake package for
 find_package(Motif CONFIG), the Motif bitmaps and the manual pages of
 the library functions and widgets.

Package: mwm
Section: x11
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Motif Window Manager
 Motif is the user interface toolkit of the Common Desktop Environment:
 a set of widgets (buttons, menus, lists, text fields, dialogs, ...) for
 X11 applications, built on the X Toolkit Intrinsics.
 .
 This package contains mwm, the Motif window manager, and xmbind, which
 sets the virtual key bindings of Motif programs for a display.

Package: uil
Section: devel
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Motif - UIL (User Interface Language) compiler
 Motif is the user interface toolkit of the Common Desktop Environment:
 a set of widgets (buttons, menus, lists, text fields, dialogs, ...) for
 X11 applications, built on the X Toolkit Intrinsics.
 .
 This package contains uil, which compiles UIL interface descriptions
 into the UID files that libMrm loads.
